WEBVTT

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:03.520
We're sorry.

00:00:03.530 --> 00:00:06.710
To meet our needs, we 
made you lose on purpose.

00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:10.760
But now we want you to fight for us again.

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:14.210
Don't worry about it.  It couldn't be helped.

00:00:14.630 --> 00:00:20.720
We deal with any situation.  We understand 
that that is our job as assassins.

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:28.800
Your dueling style is 
always calm and composed.

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:33.590
There's a duelist that we want 
you to save using your power.

00:00:33.590 --> 00:00:35.920
Who is it?

00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:03.390
No matter how far apart we 
are, we can't be stopped

00:01:03.470 --> 00:01:08.390
That's deeply engraved into us

00:01:08.560 --> 00:01:16.920
So don't be afraid of getting hurt

00:01:19.340 --> 00:01:22.920
Break through even further

00:01:23.280 --> 00:01:28.410
While carrying you beliefs in your heart

00:01:29.880 --> 00:01:35.500
There's always only one truth

00:01:35.720 --> 00:01:39.390
So feel the voice of your heart

00:01:40.660 --> 00:01:44.180
With your unwavering emotions

00:01:44.660 --> 00:01:50.280
Seize the signs of tomorrow

00:02:19.470 --> 00:02:25.270
Ancient Forest Invitation to the Spirit World

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:37.520
Nicely done, Bro!

00:02:37.520 --> 00:02:40.260
All right!  He made it to the second round!

00:02:40.570 --> 00:02:42.750
That was a really heated battle!

00:02:43.020 --> 00:02:46.450
Right?  Yusei is an incredible duelist!

00:02:46.450 --> 00:02:50.700
That's right, unlike a certain 
someone who lost in the first round.

00:02:54.130 --> 00:02:57.430
What are you talking about?  
Luca, you were the one who lost!

00:02:57.430 --> 00:03:00.620
It doesn't count against my official record!

00:03:00.620 --> 00:03:02.820
Official record?  Whatever!

00:03:02.820 --> 00:03:04.770
Everybody!

00:03:05.790 --> 00:03:08.460
There's a sudden turn of events!

00:03:08.460 --> 00:03:12.690
Godwin has just given a 
surprise announcement!

00:03:12.690 --> 00:03:17.530
Are the people who lost in 
the first round listening?

00:03:17.530 --> 00:03:22.120
There's going to be a second chance battle!

00:03:25.420 --> 00:03:28.420
Hooray!  I can duel again!

00:03:28.420 --> 00:03:30.230
That's great, Lua!

00:03:30.230 --> 00:03:32.120
This time, I'm going to win!

00:03:33.130 --> 00:03:35.260
Lua is getting overexcited again.

00:03:52.030 --> 00:03:55.380
What should I put in my 
deck?  I have to rebuild it.

00:03:56.420 --> 00:03:58.650
Luca, let me borrow your clothes again.

00:03:58.650 --> 00:03:59.850
No way.

00:03:59.850 --> 00:04:01.360
Why not?

00:04:03.310 --> 00:04:07.630
I will now announce the matchup 
of the second chance battle!

00:04:07.630 --> 00:04:12.130
There will only be one matchup 
between two random participants!

00:04:12.130 --> 00:04:14.520
The lucky participants are…

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:22.120
Though she lost to Bommer, Godwin recognizes 
that she has skills at only eleven years of age!

00:04:22.120 --> 00:04:27.890
There's no ceiling to her potential!  The 
dueling angel who came down from the heavens!

00:04:27.890 --> 00:04:30.950
Miss Luca!

00:04:37.460 --> 00:04:38.500
Luca…

00:04:39.080 --> 00:04:42.250
That child is the real Luca, right?

00:04:42.620 --> 00:04:49.640
The fake one dueled pretty well, but 
I wonder how the real one will do?

00:04:53.620 --> 00:04:55.110
What should I do?

00:04:55.300 --> 00:04:59.450
What should you do?  Luca 
is a participant, after all.

00:04:59.450 --> 00:05:01.520
But I'm Luca!

00:05:01.520 --> 00:05:06.330
But judging by the atmosphere, it'll 
be bad if Luca doesn't participate.

00:05:03.730 --> 00:05:09.440
Luca!  Luca!  Luca!

00:05:09.440 --> 00:05:12.660
But I don't want to.

00:05:12.660 --> 00:05:15.450
When I duel, I become incredibly tired.

00:05:16.940 --> 00:05:21.480
You get the chance to battle against Yusei, 
but you're going to let it go to waste.

00:05:22.200 --> 00:05:25.950
Fine.  I'll duel just this one time and win.

00:05:25.950 --> 00:05:28.320
Afterwards, you'll take my place, Lua.

00:05:28.320 --> 00:05:31.580
Really?  That's great!  I'll cheer you on!

00:05:31.580 --> 00:05:34.140
Sheesh, you're always happy 
when things go your way.

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:44.900
I'm excited.  What kind 
of deck does Luca use?

00:05:44.900 --> 00:05:46.130
It's a Fairy Deck.

00:05:46.130 --> 00:05:47.300
Fairy?

00:05:47.300 --> 00:05:51.840
Yeah.  She says that she can hear 
the voices of Duel Monsters fairies.

00:05:51.840 --> 00:05:56.470
She follows their advice to construct 
her deck.  That's why it's a Fairy Deck.

00:05:56.470 --> 00:05:58.780
Are you sure about that?

00:05:58.780 --> 00:06:02.390
When she hears the voices of the 
fairies, she becomes extremely tired.

00:06:02.390 --> 00:06:05.660
That's why she doesn't like to duel.

00:06:09.210 --> 00:06:12.280
That child is a Signer?

00:06:12.280 --> 00:06:12.980
Yes.

00:06:13.370 --> 00:06:20.290
During the first round, the D-Sensor 
detected the girl sitting in the crowd.

00:06:21.140 --> 00:06:27.460
This second chance battle is to 
confirm that she is a Signer.

00:06:28.580 --> 00:06:32.090
It's spinning!

00:06:32.490 --> 00:06:36.980
Yes, everything is okay!  Look for yourself!

00:06:36.980 --> 00:06:45.330
If we detect a signal beyond this mark, 
we can definitely say that she's a Signer!

00:06:47.270 --> 00:06:56.040
I invited her to this tournament because I've been 
interested in her since an incident eight years ago.

00:06:56.600 --> 00:06:57.950
Eight years ago?

00:07:02.790 --> 00:07:07.680
Since the age of three, she was 
a genius who excelled in dueling.

00:07:07.680 --> 00:07:10.910
But one day, during the middle of a duel,

00:07:10.910 --> 00:07:14.910
she suddenly fell unconscious and didn't 
regain consciousness for a month.

00:07:14.910 --> 00:07:21.900
Her twin brother Lua called 
out her name the entire time,

00:07:21.900 --> 00:07:26.740
and she miraculously recovered a month later.

00:07:26.740 --> 00:07:29.640
What does that have to do with Signers?

00:07:30.120 --> 00:07:35.780
What attracted our attention was 
what she said after she recovered.

00:07:35.780 --> 00:07:41.820
She said that during the month, she was 
in the spirit world of Duel Monsters.

00:07:42.530 --> 00:07:45.490
Spirit world of Duel Monsters?

00:07:45.490 --> 00:07:52.160
The origin of Duel Monsters is surrounded 
in mystery, and many legends exist.

00:07:53.110 --> 00:07:56.520
After she recovered, she 
recited some of those legends.

00:07:56.520 --> 00:08:00.850
Many of them matched up 
with the spirit world.

00:08:00.850 --> 00:08:05.450
Including the legend of 
the people of the stars...

00:08:09.360 --> 00:08:16.060
It's been eight years, but the two 
do not remember that incident.

00:08:16.590 --> 00:08:20.760
Therefore, we have to make 
her go to that world again.

00:08:20.760 --> 00:08:23.580
To the spirit world of Duel Monsters.

00:08:25.310 --> 00:08:31.310
If she does, we might be able 
to learn her true power.

00:08:33.630 --> 00:08:38.890
The dueling genius Luca makes 
her entrance on to the field!

00:08:40.860 --> 00:08:44.950
He's right.  This Duel Disk 
feels very easy to use.

00:08:45.720 --> 00:08:46.890
Yusei…

00:08:51.620 --> 00:08:57.660
The dueling genius Luca's opponent will be...

00:08:59.550 --> 00:09:01.090
There he is!

00:09:01.090 --> 00:09:05.660
Nicknamed the Duel Counselor, 
it's Professor Frank!

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:23.740
Nice to meet you, Luca.

00:09:23.740 --> 00:09:25.650
Hi.

00:09:26.740 --> 00:09:33.630
Now, let's duel to find your true self 
hidden deep within your consciousness.

00:09:34.050 --> 00:09:35.190
He seems…

00:09:37.450 --> 00:09:40.480
You have a bad feeling about him too?

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:43.520
Now it's about to begin!

00:09:48.350 --> 00:09:51.300
Start the second chance battle!

00:09:51.300 --> 00:09:52.370
Duel!

00:09:53.780 --> 00:09:56.010
I'll finish this duel quickly.

00:09:56.010 --> 00:09:57.310
My turn!

00:09:58.000 --> 00:09:59.310
I draw.

00:10:00.020 --> 00:10:03.210
I summon Sunny Pixie in defense position.

00:10:09.970 --> 00:10:11.670
It really is a fairy!

00:10:11.670 --> 00:10:13.420
Do your best, Luca!

00:10:13.420 --> 00:10:15.360
I end my turn.

00:10:16.500 --> 00:10:18.210
It's my turn.

00:10:18.610 --> 00:10:19.770
I draw.

00:10:20.150 --> 00:10:23.900
I summon Symmetry Rorschach.

00:10:29.740 --> 00:10:32.270
What's that monster?

00:10:33.010 --> 00:10:36.100
I'm sure you know what a Rorschach test is.

00:10:36.520 --> 00:10:41.470
How you feel determines what 
this monster looks like.

00:10:41.890 --> 00:10:49.420
It's a psychological test that reveals 
your uncertainties, worries and problems.

00:10:49.950 --> 00:10:55.850
Luca, what does this 
monster look like to you?

00:10:56.270 --> 00:10:58.240
Who is this person?

00:10:58.690 --> 00:11:02.280
Now answer.  What is it?

00:11:03.050 --> 00:11:04.510
It's...

00:11:05.180 --> 00:11:06.990
Now…

00:11:21.790 --> 00:11:23.570
Now…

00:11:23.570 --> 00:11:26.550
Now what is it?

00:11:26.550 --> 00:11:28.360
I know!  It's Crystal Skull!

00:11:28.360 --> 00:11:29.820
A butterfly!

00:11:29.820 --> 00:11:33.360
Luca isn't comfortable with this opponent.

00:11:36.490 --> 00:11:38.040
Now…

00:11:38.510 --> 00:11:40.060
Now…

00:11:40.990 --> 00:11:42.260
Now…

00:11:43.110 --> 00:11:45.560
What does it look like?

00:11:46.380 --> 00:11:47.850
It looks like...

00:11:52.050 --> 00:11:53.240
A fairy?

00:12:01.830 --> 00:12:03.930
Spiral Mind!

00:12:11.160 --> 00:12:17.350
This test reveals what you're 
afraid of deep in your mind.

00:12:17.350 --> 00:12:22.380
You're afraid of fairies 
and spirits.  Am I wrong?

00:12:22.910 --> 00:12:24.370
That's not true.

00:12:24.370 --> 00:12:26.020
It'll be fine.

00:12:26.020 --> 00:12:32.290
In this duel, I'll reveal your 
fears so that you can be set free.

00:12:32.640 --> 00:12:35.590
In order to do that, be courageous 
and go to the other world

00:12:35.590 --> 00:12:38.330
that's hidden deep within your consciousness.

00:12:38.970 --> 00:12:43.400
You must travel to the spirit 
world of Duel Monsters.

00:12:43.400 --> 00:12:46.300
Spirit world of Duel Monsters?

00:12:46.300 --> 00:12:51.700
I know that you can hear the spirits' voices.

00:12:51.700 --> 00:12:57.890
Then that means the spirit world of 
Duel Monsters must also exist, right?

00:12:58.580 --> 00:13:01.400
That world exists?

00:13:01.930 --> 00:13:05.200
Symmetry Rorschach's 
monster effect activates.

00:13:05.200 --> 00:13:11.740
When it destroys your monster, the top 
card in your deck is turned faceup.

00:13:11.740 --> 00:13:13.470
Peeping Mind!

00:13:20.590 --> 00:13:21.710
Kuribon.

00:13:21.710 --> 00:13:24.560
That's a cute spirit card.

00:13:25.030 --> 00:13:28.940
Can you also hear its voice?

00:13:28.940 --> 00:13:33.040
It's true that I can hear 
the voices of spirits.

00:13:33.040 --> 00:13:35.720
But...  Lua…

00:13:39.550 --> 00:13:43.140
Luca!

00:13:44.920 --> 00:13:46.460
That was...

00:13:49.810 --> 00:13:51.860
What's wrong, Lua?

00:13:52.340 --> 00:13:55.920
I feel really scared.

00:13:55.920 --> 00:13:59.960
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:14:00.840 --> 00:14:02.600
It's your turn.

00:14:04.460 --> 00:14:05.570
I draw.

00:14:07.650 --> 00:14:09.610
Come, Kuribon!

00:14:12.430 --> 00:14:15.620
At this moment, I flip over my facedown card!

00:14:15.620 --> 00:14:18.410
Light to the Depths!

00:14:19.720 --> 00:14:23.800
You send the top five cards in 
your deck to your graveyard.

00:14:24.150 --> 00:14:28.030
We both get to look at the sixth card, 
and you add that card to your hand.

00:14:28.570 --> 00:14:35.480
If you don't play that card this 
turn, you take 2000 points of damage.

00:14:36.760 --> 00:14:41.460
Now draw the cards at the top of your deck.

00:14:41.460 --> 00:14:42.510
Slowly.

00:14:43.240 --> 00:14:44.250
One.

00:14:44.940 --> 00:14:46.380
Two.

00:14:47.600 --> 00:14:48.930
Three.

00:14:50.530 --> 00:14:51.930
Four.

00:14:53.080 --> 00:14:54.700
Five.

00:14:57.200 --> 00:15:02.060
What's the sixth card?

00:15:06.130 --> 00:15:10.680
That's the Field Spell Ancient Forest.

00:15:10.940 --> 00:15:15.650
All monsters switch to attack position, 
and neither of us can summon a monster

00:15:15.650 --> 00:15:19.450
in defense position or switch 
them to defense position.

00:15:19.450 --> 00:15:25.160
Monsters that attack are destroyed 
at the end of the Battle Phase.

00:15:26.310 --> 00:15:33.670
A world where everything is revealed 
and fighting isn't allowed.

00:15:34.440 --> 00:15:39.520
Now go to the spirit world of Duel Monsters.

00:15:45.130 --> 00:15:46.540
Where am I?

00:15:58.850 --> 00:15:59.960
Kuribon!

00:16:01.500 --> 00:16:03.360
Is this really the place?

00:16:04.160 --> 00:16:08.120
Is this the spirit world of Duel 
Monsters that he was talking about?

00:16:10.200 --> 00:16:15.700
This place is calm and 
beautiful, but I feel scared.

00:16:18.330 --> 00:16:25.300
It seems that you went to the spirit world 
sealed deep within your consciousness.

00:16:26.600 --> 00:16:27.660
I draw.

00:16:28.190 --> 00:16:32.550
I activate the Continuous Trap Gestalt Trap.

00:16:32.550 --> 00:16:36.490
This card equips on to 
the opponent's monster.

00:16:38.060 --> 00:16:40.530
I equip this card on to Kuribon.

00:16:40.980 --> 00:16:44.930
The equipped monster's 
monster effects are negated,

00:16:44.930 --> 00:16:48.660
and its attack and defense 
points both become zero.

00:16:54.010 --> 00:16:55.810
Kuribon!  What's wrong?

00:16:56.420 --> 00:17:02.990
Then from my hand, I equip the Equip 
Spell Immortal Homeostasis on to Kuribon.

00:17:04.770 --> 00:17:07.780
The equipped monster cannot 
be destroyed in battle.

00:17:08.200 --> 00:17:14.600
During your Standby Phase, if the equipped 
monster's attack points are different

00:17:14.600 --> 00:17:18.600
than its original attack points, 
then you take 300 points of damage.

00:17:19.130 --> 00:17:25.930
In other words, if Kuribon's attack points 
remain at zero, you'll take damage every turn.

00:17:26.310 --> 00:17:31.190
Then I release Symmetry Rorschach.

00:17:32.150 --> 00:17:35.790
I Advance Summon Ido the 
Supreme Magical Force.

00:17:49.500 --> 00:17:50.610
Kuribon!

00:17:58.100 --> 00:18:00.960
When Ido is destroyed, it is Special Summoned

00:18:00.960 --> 00:18:04.060
on to my field during the 
End Phase of that turn.

00:18:04.080 --> 00:18:10.200
And as long as I have Ido, I am not 
allowed to summon other monsters.

00:18:15.570 --> 00:18:16.950
What are you doing?

00:18:16.950 --> 00:18:18.780
You're going to lose again!

00:18:19.020 --> 00:18:23.540
What's wrong, Luca?  She's 
completely lost concentration!

00:18:27.670 --> 00:18:28.860
Hey.

00:18:29.840 --> 00:18:30.880
Lua?

00:18:32.460 --> 00:18:35.290
Ido the Supreme Magical 
Force attacks Kuribon!

00:18:36.300 --> 00:18:38.450
Violent Egoism!

00:18:59.740 --> 00:19:05.410
Due to the effect of Immortal 
Homeostasis, Kuribon is not destroyed.

00:19:05.890 --> 00:19:11.200
However, it will taste eternal 
pain in the world of the undead.

00:19:11.200 --> 00:19:15.610
Luca, you have to remember.

00:19:16.070 --> 00:19:19.280
From within pain and fear...

00:19:19.580 --> 00:19:21.990
Remember what your true mission is!

00:19:21.990 --> 00:19:23.320
Now...

00:19:25.160 --> 00:19:26.750
Now...

00:19:27.290 --> 00:19:29.810
Now...

00:19:30.340 --> 00:19:34.090
Now...

00:19:37.570 --> 00:19:38.880
That's right.

00:19:38.880 --> 00:19:41.480
You're not allowed to fight in this forest!

00:19:55.330 --> 00:19:57.750
No way…

00:19:59.500 --> 00:20:04.530
When Ido is destroyed, it's Special Summoned 
during the End Phase of that turn.

00:20:05.910 --> 00:20:07.610
I end my turn.

00:20:07.610 --> 00:20:10.270
Now it's your turn.

00:20:11.730 --> 00:20:12.660
I draw.

00:20:12.660 --> 00:20:16.800
During this Standby Phase, 
you take 300 points of damage

00:20:16.800 --> 00:20:20.500
due to the effect of Immortal Homeostasis.

00:20:31.780 --> 00:20:34.750
I summon Sunlight Unicorn.

00:20:42.170 --> 00:20:46.320
I equip Horn of the Unicorn 
on to Sunlight Unicorn.

00:20:53.310 --> 00:20:57.220
It has more attack points than Ido.

00:21:17.100 --> 00:21:19.200
Sunlight Unicorn…

00:21:20.690 --> 00:21:23.400
Luca…

00:21:23.990 --> 00:21:26.590
Who is it?

00:21:27.100 --> 00:21:31.990
Luca, you came to fulfill your promise.

00:21:32.490 --> 00:21:33.930
Promise?

00:21:34.410 --> 00:21:41.110
To protect the spirit world 
of Duel Monsters from evil.

00:21:41.110 --> 00:21:42.780
Who are you?

00:21:43.290 --> 00:21:44.720
Who are you?

00:22:03.690 --> 00:22:09.270
What can we grasp?  What can we do?

00:22:09.620 --> 00:22:14.650
We'll step forward and find out

00:22:15.030 --> 00:22:20.580
My unstoppable emotions, the 
beating of my passionate heart

00:22:20.740 --> 00:22:25.820
I heard the voice of truth

00:22:26.010 --> 00:22:28.980
After I was hurt, I learned

00:22:31.550 --> 00:22:34.570
Of a place where I can become stronger

00:22:36.520 --> 00:22:41.730
I stack my dreams in my palm

00:22:41.860 --> 00:22:47.130
And I'll someday pass them to you

00:22:47.560 --> 00:22:53.070
Seeking for the signal 
to start, my soul roars

00:22:53.370 --> 00:22:58.410
I will overcome my suffocating 
and mediocre life

00:22:58.940 --> 00:23:04.470
I'll dash and acquire all the bright futures

00:23:04.620 --> 00:23:13.890
Carrying the bonds I believe 
in, I run towards tomorrow
